sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a GetInstalledCertificateIdsRequest<br>with certificateType ManufacturerRootCertificate

    CSMS->>CS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsRequest (certificateType = ManufacturerRootCertificate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateType is ManufacturerRootCertificate

    CS-->>CSMS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsResponse (status = NotFound, certificateHashDataChain omitted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
